---
// A pull request check from the Clearance GitHub App, holding a tier 2 change.
---
<div class="cockpit gh" role="img" aria-label="A Clearance check on a pull request: tier 2, holding for one named human, with the provenance, policy and rendered tree it is bound to">
  <div class="chrome"><span class="dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="crumb">skyport-broker / pull / <b>209</b> · checks</span></div>
  <div class="row">
    <span class="ico a"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12"><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="4" fill="currentColor"/></svg></span>
    <div>
      <div class="t">Clearance · Tier 2, holding short</div>
      <div class="d">Renders new <code>replicas</code> and an HPA for skyport-broker. Needs one named human from <b>platform-oncall</b> who did not start this change.</div>
      <dl class="kv">
        <dt>Provenance</dt><dd>probable agent · bot identity, no signature</dd>
        <dt>Policy</dt><dd>clearance.yaml@7e2d · kyverno 1.13 · pass</dd>
        <dt>Bound to</dt><dd>tree e71d…a40c · 2 objects → skyport-broker-prod</dd>
        <dt>Outage</dt><dd>hold (tier 2 default)</dd>
      </dl>
      <div class="bt"><span class="ok">Review and clear</span><span>Why tier 2?</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <span class="ico g"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.6 9.6 3.6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
    <div><div class="t">Glidepath · build, test, sign</div><div class="d">SLSA provenance from Tekton Chains · 4m 12s</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <span class="ico s"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path d="M3 6h6M6 3v6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span>
    <div><div class="t">Deployment protection rule · skyport-broker-prod</div><div class="d">GitHub is waiting on Clearance before it deploys</div></div>
  </div>
</div>
